    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2021 gross claims outstanding were GBP 731.704m. Using the gross claims development table, the syndicate experienced overall favourable prior-year development of about GBP 16.24m (a ~2.22% reduction of opening gross reserves), driven by favourable run-off on back years. The syndicate continues to hold material COVID-19 related reserves (gross ultimate $82.4m) and retains IBNR for litigation; several named large losses (Golden Ray, MSC Flaminia, Chile riots) and natural catastrophes (Hurricane Laura, Ida, Winter Storm Uri) influenced reserves across Marine, Property, Energy and Accident & Health lines.",
